  <name>Boot Video Manager</name>
  <summary>Custom startup videos for Steam</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.robocnop">
    <name>Robocnop</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Boot Video Manager lets you browse the thousands of community startup videos and suspend animations of
      steamdeckrepo.com, preview them, and install them in a single click for Steam Big Picture and the Steam Deck.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Search, filter and sort the whole catalog, with a live preview of every video</li>
      <li>Install, enable, disable or remove videos without touching Steam's files by hand</li>
      <li>Turns on Steam's random startup movie option so your videos actually play</li>
      <li>Import your own .webm files and share your selection as a video pack</li>
      <li>Sign in with Steam to like videos and find your likes</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This is an unofficial application, not affiliated with Valve or steamdeckrepo.com. Every video belongs to its
      author.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.Robocnop.BootVideoManager.desktop</launchable>

